## Ringkasan
MariaDB punya **Stored Function** (return value, bisa di SELECT) dan **Stored Procedure** (panggil via `CALL`, bisa banyak result set). **KEUNGGULAN MariaDB**: mode kompatibilitas **Oracle PL/SQL** (`sql_mode=ORACLE`) — bisa jalankan banyak kode Oracle tanpa ubah!

## Stored Function (Return 1 Nilai)
```sql
DELIMITER //
CREATE FUNCTION slugify(input VARCHAR(255))
RETURNS VARCHAR(255)
DETERMINISTIC
NO SQL
BEGIN
  DECLARE result VARCHAR(255);
  SET result = LOWER(TRIM(input));
  SET result = REGEXP_REPLACE(result, '[^a-z0-9]+', '-');
  SET result = TRIM(BOTH '-' FROM result);
  RETURN result;
END //
DELIMITER ;

-- Pakai seperti fungsi built-in
SELECT slugify('Hello World! 123');  -- hello-world-123
UPDATE posts SET slug = slugify(title);
