# Abstract Class

## Ringkasan

Abstract class adalah Class yang gak bisa di-instantiate langsung — harus di-extend dulu. Bisa punya campuran abstract methods (tanpa body, wajib diimplementasi child) dan concrete methods (dengan body, langsung diwarisi). Cocok buat template method pattern.

---

## Syntax

```php
<?php
abstract class Notification
{
    abstract protected function getChannel(): string;
    abstract protected function formatMessage(string $msg): string;

    // Concrete method — shared behavior
    public function send(string $to, string $message): void
    {
        $formatted = $this->formatMessage($message);
        $channel = $this->getChannel();
        // send via channel...
        echo "[{$channel}] To: {$to} — {$formatted}\n";
    }
}

