# Interface

## Ringkasan

Interface mendefinisikan "kontrak" — method signatures yang HARUS diimplementasikan oleh Class yang `implements` interface tersebut. Berbeda dengan Inheritance, satu class bisa implements **banyak interface**. Interface sangat penting buat Polymorphism dan dependency inversion.

---

## Syntax

```php
<?php
interface Renderable
{
    public function render(): string;
}

interface Cacheable
{
    public function getCacheKey(): string;
    public function getCacheTTL(): int;
}

class Article implements Renderable, Cacheable
{
    public function render(): string { return '<article>...</article>'; }
    public function getCacheKey(): string { return 'article_' . $this->id; }
    public function getCacheTTL(): int { return 3600; }
}
```

